---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing — WEBAO · One simple plan, $149 CAD/month"
  description="One plan that actually includes everything: custom 3–5 page site, domain, hosting, SEO, analytics and support. No setup fee. Cancel anytime. See what's included."
>
  <!-- Header intro -->
  <section class="pricing-hero grain">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="pricing-hero-grid">
        <div data-reveal>
          <div class="eyebrow">Pricing — no packages to decode</div>
          <h1 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6.5vw, 5.6rem); line-height:.88; margin-top:12px;">
            One plan.<br />
            <span style="font-style: italic; font-weight:400; color: var(--accent);">Everything</span> included.
          </h1>
          <p class="prose" style="margin-top:16px; max-width: 52ch;">
            We kept it simple on purpose. Most small businesses need the same thing — a credible, findable site that stays correct. This one plan does that, for $149/month. No setup fee. No “contact sales.”
          </p>
          <div class="cluster" style="margin-top:18px;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Start your site — 3 spots left →</a>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px; color: var(--muted);">Avg. reply 3h · Same-day draft preview</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-hero-card" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.14em; opacity:.5;">WEBAO STANDARD</div>
          <div style="display:flex; align-items: baseline; gap:8px; margin-top:12px;">
            <span class="display" style="font-size: 3.8rem; line-height:.9;">$149</span>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.3; opacity:.6;">CAD / month<br />+ tax · cancel anytime</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px; font-size:13px; color: var(--muted);">For most trades, shops, restaurants and local services. 3–5 pages, art-directed.</div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--dark" style="width:100%; margin-top:18px; justify-content:center;">Get started →</a>
          <div class="mono" style="margin-top:10px; font-size:11px; text-align:center; color: var(--muted);">No setup fee · Hosting & domain included</div>
          <div class="trust-row">
            <span>◐ SSL</span><span>◑ Backups</span><span>◎ CDN</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 28px;">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="compare" data-reveal>
        <div class="compare-head">
          <h2>What you get — and what you don’t have to think about</h2>
          <p class="mono">Everything a local business site actually needs. Nothing you’ll never use.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="compare-grid">
          <!-- Included -->
          <div class="compare-card compare-card--included">
            <div class="compare-label mono">INCLUDED — IN YOUR $149</div>
            <ul role="list">
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Custom 3–5 page design</strong><span>Home + 2–4 pages (Services, About, Contact, etc.). Art-directed for your trade, not a template.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Custom domain</strong><span>votreentreprise.ca — we register, configure, and renew it. Email forwarding included.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Hosting, SSL, CDN</strong><span>On Cloudflare’s edge. Fast in Vancouver, Montréal, and everywhere in between.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Mobile, SEO, analytics</strong><span>Mobile-first, semantic HTML, sitemap, Google Business setup, and simple monthly analytics.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Contact / quote form</strong><span>Spam-filtered, goes to your email/phone. No third-party embed that breaks.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Backups & security</strong><span>Daily backups, updates, and monitoring. If something breaks, we fix it.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Small updates within 24h</strong><span>Hours, photos, prices, promos — send a text or email, we ship it. No CMS to learn.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Real human support</strong><span>Same person who built your site. Mon–Fri 9–5 ET. No ticket system.</span></div></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Not included / extra -->
          <div class="compare-card compare-card--muted">
            <div class="compare-label mono">NOT IN THIS PLAN — ASK IF YOU NEED IT</div>
            <ul role="list">
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">—</span><div><strong>6+ pages / multi-language</strong><span>We do it, just not in the base plan. ~+$25/mo per extra section or language.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">—</span><div><strong>E-commerce / booking system</strong><span>Simple booking (Calendly) included. Full shop needs a tailored quote — we’re honest if you don’t need it.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">—</span><div><strong>Logo & brand system</strong><span>Wordmark + palette included. Full identity? We partner with local designers.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">—</span><div><strong>Copywriting from scratch</strong><span>We shape what you send. Need us to write everything? +$400 one-time, no fluff.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">—</span><div><strong>Ad spend / social</strong><span>We don’t upsell ads. We’ll set up your Google Business so you show up organically.</span></div></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="callout">
              <div style="font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Good news: most businesses don’t need extras.</div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color: var(--muted); margin-top:6px;">The base plan is built for the 80% — electricians, plumbers, landscapers, restaurants, clinics. If you’re the 20% that needs more, we’ll say so upfront with a clear price.</p>
              <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-flex; margin-top:12px; font-weight:650; font-size:13px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset:3px;">Ask for a tailored quote →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="compare-foot mono" data-reveal>
          <span>NO LOCK-IN · No page-builder to escape later. It’s a clean static site you can take anywhere.</span>
          <span style="opacity:.5;">→ Compare that to Wix / Squarespace “$29/mo + extras” that ends up $90 and you still maintain it.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process + timeline -->
  <section class="section section--dark grain" style="padding-block: clamp(40px,6vw,80px);">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="timeline-grid" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow" style="color: rgba(248,245,239,.5);">Timeline — live in a week, without you chasing us</div>
          <h2 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); margin-top:10px; line-height:.92; color: var(--paper);">From “we need a site”<br /><span style="font-style: italic; font-weight:400; color: #FF8A7A;">to “it’s live”.</span></h2>
          <p style="margin-top:14px; color: rgba(248,245,239,.64); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; max-width: 42ch;">You send basics. We do the work. One feedback round. Then we launch and keep it alive.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="timeline" role="list">
          <li><span class="t-n">1</span><div><strong>Day 0 — You send the basics</strong><span>Photos, services, area, logo (if you have one). 15-min call or form.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="t-n">2</span><div><strong>Day 2 — Private preview</strong><span>A real URL on your phone. Click everything. Tell us what feels off.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="t-n">3</span><div><strong>Day 4 — Revisions</strong><span>We polish. Typography, copy, photos, SEO. One tight round so it ships.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="t-n">4</span><div><strong>Day 5–7 — Launch</strong><span>Domain, hosting, SSL, analytics. We flip the switch and send you the “it’s live” text.</span></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Example quote -->
  <section class="section grain">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="quote-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="quote-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="invoice">
            <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; opacity:.5;">INVOICE — WEBAO — JUNE 2026</div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;">
              <span style="font-weight:750; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Dubois HVAC — Laval</span>
              <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px; background: #00C950; color:white; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:99px;">PAID</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px; height:1px; background: var(--line);"></div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px; display:grid; gap:8px; font-size:13px;">
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between;"><span>WEBAO Standard</span><span style="font-weight:650;">$149.00</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; color: var(--muted);"><span>Tax (GST/QST)</span><span>$22.31</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:750; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:8px; margin-top:4px;"><span>Total</span><span>$171.31</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:14px; background: var(--paper-2); border-radius:10px; padding:10px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color: var(--muted);">Next renewal: July 3, 2026 · Cancel anytime in your email. No portal to forget.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">No surprises — the bill looks like this, every month</div>
          <h2 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); margin-top:10px; line-height:.92;">Predictable.<br />Boring (in a good way).</h2>
          <p class="prose" style="margin-top:12px; font-size:14.5px;">No “intro pricing,” no yearly trap, no “that’ll be extra.” You know the price before we start, and it stays that price until you ask for more scope.</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>→ Monthly, not annual commitment</li>
            <li>→ Cancel by email — we don’t make you call</li>
            <li>→ Take your site with you if you leave</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top:16px;">Start at $149/mo →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ mini -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="faq-compact" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="display" style="font-size:1.6rem; line-height:1;">Common questions about pricing</h3>
        <div class="faq-mini-grid">
          <details open><summary>What if I need a 6th page later?</summary><div><p>Add it for ~$25/mo or as a one-time $300 build — your call. Most add it monthly so we also maintain it.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Do you charge for photos or copy tweaks?</summary><div><p>Small updates (swap a photo, fix hours, add a service) are included. Full re-write or new photoshoot direction is billed as a one-time.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What about email (info@...)?</summary><div><p>We set up forwarding (info@ → your Gmail/Outlook). Full mailbox hosting (Google Workspace) is ~$9/user/mo via Google — we set it up, you pay Google directly.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Can I pay yearly?</summary><div><p>Yep — 2 months free if you prepay 12 ($1,490/yr). Still cancel anytime with prorated refund.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band grain" style="padding-block: 40px;">
    <div class="shell" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;">
      <div>
        <div class="mono" style="color: rgba(248,245,239,.5); font-size:11px;">READY TO SHIP — 2 SPOTS LEFT FOR JANUARY</div>
        <h2 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-top:6px; color: var(--paper);">Start at $149. <span style="font-style: italic; font-weight:400; color:#FF8A7A;">No pitch.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cluster">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary" style="background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);">Start your site →</a>
        <a href="/demos" class="btn" style="color: var(--paper); border-color: rgba(248,245,239,.18);">See demos first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .pricing-hero {
      padding-block: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper) 0%, var(--paper-2) 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .pricing-hero-grid {
      display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); align-items: start;
    }
    .pricing-hero-card {
      background: white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; padding:20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      position: sticky; top: calc(var(--header-h) + 16px);
    }
    .trust-row { margin-top:16px; display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.06em; color: var(--muted); }
    .trust-row span { background: var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:6px 8px; border-radius:99px; }

    .compare { display:grid; gap:18px; }
    .compare-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:750; line-height:1.1; }
    .compare-head p { margin-top:6px; font-size:12px; color: var(--muted); }
    .compare-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap:16px; align-items:start; }
    .compare-card { background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
    .compare-card--muted { background: var(--paper-2); }
    .compare-label { font-size:10px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom:10px; }
    .compare-card ul { list-style:none; padding:0; display:grid; gap:14px; }
    .compare-card li { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; gap:10px; align-items:start; }
    .ic { width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:99px; background: var(--ink); color:white; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; flex:none; }
    .ic--dash { background: var(--paper-2); color: var(--ink); border:1px solid var(--line); }
    .compare-card li strong { display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.25; }
    .compare-card li span { display:block; font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color: var(--muted); margin-top:2px; }
    .callout { margin-top:18px; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:14px; }
    .compare-foot { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; justify-content:space-between; padding:12px 14px; background: var(--ink); color: rgba(248,245,239,.7); border-radius:12px; font-size:11px; }

    .timeline-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 24px; align-items:start; }
    .timeline { list-style:none; padding:0; display:grid; gap:10px; }
    .timeline li { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; gap:14px; align-items:start; background: rgba(248,245,239,.06); border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark); border-radius:14px; padding:14px; }
    .t-n { width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:10px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); display:grid; place-items:center; font-weight:750; font-size:13px; }
    .timeline li strong { display:block; color: var(--paper); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
    .timeline li span { display:block; color: rgba(248,245,239,.6); font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; margin-top:2px; }

    .quote-card { display:grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap:24px; align-items:center; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
    .invoice { background: var(--paper-3); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:16px; }
    .check-list { list-style:none; padding:0; margin-top:12px; display:grid; gap:6px; font-size:13px; color: var(--muted); }
    .faq-compact { background: var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:18px; }
    .faq-mini-grid { margin-top:14px; display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:10px; }
    .faq-mini-grid details { background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; overflow:clip; }
    .faq-mini-grid summary { padding:14px; font-weight:650; font-size:13.5px; cursor:pointer; list-style:none; }
    .faq-mini-grid summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
    .faq-mini-grid details div { padding:0 14px 14px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color: var(--muted); border-top:1px solid var(--line); margin-top:6px; padding-top:10px; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .pricing-hero-grid, .compare-grid, .timeline-grid, .quote-card, .faq-mini-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .pricing-hero-card { position: static; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
